Value Filldown,Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value Required DIRECTION (Outgoing|Inbound)
Value SCOPE (Common)
Value ACL_NAME ([^\s,]+)

# "show ip interface": the IPv4 ACL applied in each direction of each interface
# ("Inbound  access list is NAME"), one row per applied ACL; "not set" is no row. A
# "Common" access list (evaluated with the interface's own) is a row of its own scope.
# Every other line of the interface blocks is read past.
Start
  ^\S+\s+is\s+.*,\s+line\s+protocol\s+is\s+.*$$ -> Continue.Clearall
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+is\s+.*,\s+line\s+protocol\s+is\s+.*$$
  ^\s+(?:Outgoing|Inbound)\s+(?:Common\s+)?access\s+list\s+is\s+not\s+set\b.*$$
  ^\s+${DIRECTION}\s+(?:${SCOPE}\s+)?access\s+list\s+is\s+${ACL_NAME}(?:,.*)?\s*$$ -> Record
  ^.*$$
